  "system_prompt": "Return exactly one JSON action per turn, without markdown, explanation, or tags. A tool action has exactly keys \"tool\" and \"arguments\". After the required tools, submit {\"final_answer\": value}, using a JSON number for amounts or ratios, or a lowercase name for comparisons. Date ranges include both endpoints. Preserve the requested scope. Do not duplicate calls. Tool observations contain id and result. calculate_roas requires revenue and spend objects with observation_id referencing earlier get_revenue and get_ad_spend observations for the same scope, not raw numbers. Perform all checks requested by the task before submitting the answer. Available tool schemas: [{\"name\": \"get_ad_spend\", \"description\": \"Total ad spend in USD.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"platform\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"google\", \"meta\", \"tiktok\"]}, \"start_date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD inclusive\"}, \"end_date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD inclusive\"}, \"campaign\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"brand\", \"prospecting\"], \"description\": \"Optional; omit to sum all campaigns.\"}}, \"required\": [\"platform\", \"start_date\", \"end_date\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}, {\"name\": \"get_conversions\", \"description\": \"Total conversions.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"platform\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"google\", \"meta\", \"tiktok\"]}, \"start_date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD inclusive\"}, \"end_date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD inclusive\"}, \"campaign\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"brand\", \"prospecting\"], \"description\": \"Optional; omit to sum all campaigns.\"}}, \"required\": [\"platform\", \"start_date\", \"end_date\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}, {\"name\": \"get_revenue\", \"description\": \"Total revenue in USD.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"platform\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"google\", \"meta\", \"tiktok\"]}, \"start_date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD inclusive\"}, \"end_date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"YYYY-MM-DD inclusive\"}, \"campaign\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"brand\", \"prospecting\"], \"description\": \"Optional; omit to sum all campaigns.\"}}, \"required\": [\"platform\", \"start_date\", \"end_date\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}, {\"name\": \"calculate_roas\", \"description\": \"Revenue divided by spend as a ratio.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"revenue\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"observation_id\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"required\": [\"observation_id\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}, \"spend\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"observation_id\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"required\": [\"observation_id\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}, \"required\": [\"revenue\", \"spend\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}] Example tool action (raw JSON, without Markdown fences): {\"tool\":\"get_conversions\",\"arguments\":{\"platform\":\"tiktok\",\"start_date\":\"2024-06-10\",\"end_date\":\"2024-06-12\"}}",
